  {
   "id": "u5",
   "title": "En el restaurante",
   "en": "At a restaurant",
   "noteHtml": "<code>tener</code> (to have): <code>tengo, tienes, tiene, tenemos, tenéis, tienen</code>. The <code>menú del día</code> is a fixed-price lunch with a <code>primero</code> (first course), a <code>segundo</code> (main) and a drink. Ask for the bill with <code>La cuenta, por favor</code>.",
   "dialogue": [
