     "es": "Buenas noches. ¿Cuántos sois?",
     "en": "Good evening. How many of you are there?"
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Leo",
     "es": "Somos dos. ¿Hay mesa?",
     "en": "There are two of us. Is there a table?"
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Camarera",
     "es": "Sí, por aquí. Aquí tenéis la carta.",
     "en": "Yes, this way. Here is the menu."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Leo",
     "es": "¿Qué nos recomiendas?",
     "en": "What do you recommend?"
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Camarera",
     "es": "El menú del día está muy bien.",
     "en": "The set menu of the day is very good."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Leo",
     "es": "Vale. De primero, la sopa, y de segundo, el pollo.",
     "en": "OK. The soup to start, and the chicken for the main course."
